  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 299f02cab8b437643be53cf2058c1adf, type: 3}
  m_Name: YaY
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: '"YaY - You Against You"'
  description: "\"YaY is a VR horror game of the psychological nature, where the
    player must traverse a hallway several times wherein weird anomalous things are
    happening. The player is equipped with a Muse2 under the VR headset, that records
    their EEG data, or brainwaves, and sends it to the game in real-time. \r\nThis
    project aims to enlighten the challenges involved with the different phenomena
    that occur when combining all aspects of such an experience. The associated symptoms
    and emotions that are picked up by the EEG recording device and how they, from
    a developers perspective, can be used to create an adaptive experience, as well
    as the challenges they bring. The challenges of gathering meaningful data via
    playtests, in a VR horror setting are also explored, alongside a rendition of
    the author's verdict as to the viability of future potential in gaming and research.\""
  addText: 
  addText2: 
